{
  "name": "Designer Candidate App 01",
  "format": "2.0",
  "themePath": "default",
  "forms": [
    {
      "name": "Form 1",
      "startPoint": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "label": "T1",
          "style": "instructional",
          "content": "This form is used in two ways:\n1. It will collect information from your users.Each time a user submits this form an email is sent to you via a conneted process.\nNote that in this demo we display a Document, rather than sending an email.\n2. This form also appears when you choose to Edit a user record via the Administration Form.\nNote that in this case you do not want to generate an email, and you want to return to the Administration Form when you submit this form."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "label": "H1",
          "level": "main",
          "content": "User Information Form"
        },
        {
          "type": "fib",
          "label": "Q1",
          "style": "topLabels",
          "prompt": "What is your name? ____________________",
          "blanks": [
            {
              "name": "a",
              "length": 20,
              "required": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "mc",
          "label": "Q2",
          "onlyone": true,
          "required": true,
          "style": "vertical",
          "displayAs": "radio",
          "choiceSource": "manual",
          "question": "What is your favorite fruit?",
          "choices": [
            {
              "label": "a",
              "text": "Apple"
            },
            {
              "label": "b",
              "text": "Banana"
            },
            {
              "label": "c",
              "text": "Orange"
            },
            {
              "label": "d",
              "text": "Pear"
            },
            {
              "label": "e",
              "text": "Strawberries"
            },
            {
              "label": "f",
              "text": "Other"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "themePath": "default",
      "process": "Process 1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Form 2",
      "startPoint": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "label": "T1",
          "style": "instructional",
          "content": "You get to this form either via the \"Invitation\" link in the email generated by the User Information Form, or directly from your Tawala project or the link in your My Tawala area of the Web site.\nIt uses a \"Function\" to display the table below.\nThe connected process handles your choice of action.  If you enter an invalid name for Edit or Delete, an error message will be displayed.\nNote that Editing a record uses the original User Information Form, but submitting that form should not generate an email; rather it should return you to this form."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "label": "H1",
          "level": "main",
          "content": "Administration Form"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "label": "T2",
          "style": "normal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "align": "left",
              "indent": 0,
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "type": "font",
                  "nodes": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Here are the respondents to the User Information Form:"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "align": "left",
              "indent": 0,
              "nodes": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "align": "left",
              "indent": 0,
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "type": "font",
                  "nodes": [
                    {
                      "type": "itemizationTable",
                      "version": 1,
                      "form": "Form 1",
                      "columns": [
                        {
                          "header": "Name",
                          "field": "Record:Form 1:Q1:a"
                        },
                        {
                          "header": "Favorite Fruit",
                          "field": "Record:Form 1:Q2"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "fib",
          "label": "Q1",
          "style": "topLabels",
          "prompt": "To Delete or Edit a record, enter the user's name: ____________________",
          "blanks": [
            {
              "name": "a",
              "length": 20
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "mc",
          "label": "Q2",
          "onlyone": true,
          "required": true,
          "style": "vertical",
          "displayAs": "radio",
          "choiceSource": "manual",
          "question": "Choose an action",
          "choices": [
            {
              "label": "a",
              "text": "Delete record"
            },
            {
              "label": "b",
              "text": "Edit record"
            },
            {
              "label": "c",
              "text": "Exit"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "themePath": "default",
      "process": "Process 2"
    },
    {
      "name": "Form 3",
      "startPoint": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "label": "H1",
          "level": "main",
          "content": "Introduction"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "label": "T1",
          "style": "instructional",
          "content": "This is a sample project that you can build with the Tawala Designer application. After reading this Introduction, you will actually be using a demo version of the project that you are asked to build."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "label": "T2",
          "style": "instructional",
          "content": "Here are the major elements of the project:\n1. There is a User Information Form that collects information from your users (their name and their favorite fruit).\n2. Every time a user submits that form, an email is sent to you informing you of that fact.\n3. The email message contains an \"Invitation\" linkthat you can click on to take you to the Administration Form.\n4. The Administration Form allows you to see all your users' entries, and you may either Delete records, Edit records, or Exit the application."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "label": "T3",
          "style": "instructional",
          "content": "There are a few differences between this version and the one you will be building. For example the one you build should send an actual email to yourself at the end of the User Information Form, rather than simply displaying a page as we do in this demo. You also do not need to include all the instructional text that we use to explain parts of the project to you as you proceed (such as this page).\nAt the same time, you should feel free to check out the many features available to you in the Tawala Designer application, and add to or embelish your project in any way you desire.\nPress the Submit button below to proceed. Good luck, and have fun!"
        }
      ],
      "themePath": "default",
      "process": "Process 3"
    }
  ],
  "processes": [
    {
      "name": "Process 1",
      "commands": [
        {
          "cmd": "if",
          "condition": {
            "field": "EditingRecord",
            "op": "equals",
            "value": "true"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "cmd": "set",
              "field": "EditingRecord",
              "value": "false",
              "concat": false,
              "arithmeticAsText": false
            },
            {
              "cmd": "show",
              "form": "Form 2"
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "cmd": "showDocument",
              "document": "Document 1",
              "reset": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Process 2",
      "commands": [
        {
          "cmd": "if",
          "condition": {
            "field": "Form 2:Q2",
            "op": "mcEquals",
            "value": "c"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "cmd": "showDocument",
              "document": "Document 2",
              "reset": false
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "cmd": "set",
              "field": "count",
              "value": "0",
              "concat": false,
              "arithmeticAsText": false
            },
            {
              "cmd": "get",
              "recordList": "Record List 1",
              "sourceForms": [
                "Form 1"
              ],
              "where": {
                "field": "Record List 1:Form 1:Q1:a",
                "op": "equals",
                "value": "<<Form 2:Q1:a>>"
              }
            },
            {
              "cmd": "foreach",
              "recordName": "Record",
              "recordList": "Record List 1",
              "do": [
                {
                  "cmd": "set",
                  "field": "count",
                  "value": "<<count>> + 1",
                  "concat": false,
                  "arithmeticAsText": false
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "cmd": "if",
              "condition": {
                "field": "count",
                "op": "equals",
                "value": "0"
              },
              "then": [
                {
                  "cmd": "showDocument",
                  "document": "Document 3",
                  "reset": false
                }
              ],
              "else": [
                {
                  "cmd": "if",
                  "condition": {
                    "field": "Form 2:Q2",
                    "op": "mcEquals",
                    "value": "a"
                  },
                  "then": [
                    {
                      "cmd": "delete",
                      "form": "Form 1",
                      "from": "Form 1",
                      "where": {
                        "field": "Record:Form 1:Q1:a",
                        "op": "equals",
                        "value": "<<Form 2:Q1:a>>"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cmd": "if",
                  "condition": {
                    "field": "Form 2:Q2",
                    "op": "mcEquals",
                    "value": "b"
                  },
                  "then": [
                    {
                      "cmd": "set",
                      "field": "EditingRecord",
                      "value": "true",
                      "concat": false,
                      "arithmeticAsText": false
                    },
                    {
                      "cmd": "edit",
                      "form": "Form 1",
                      "submit": "modify",
                      "condition": {
                        "field": "Record:Form 1:Q1:a",
                        "op": "equals",
                        "value": "<<Form 2:Q1:a>>"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "cmd": "show",
              "form": "Form 2"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Process 3",
      "commands": [
        {
          "cmd": "show",
          "form": "Form 1"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "documents": [
    {
      "name": "Document 1",
      "content": "<p><span>When implemented by you, submitting the previous Form should generate an email to you with the following message:</span></p><p></p><p><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><p></p><p><span><span class=\"field-token function-table-token\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-field-name=\"Form 1:Q1:a\" title=\"Form 1:Q1:a\" draggable=\"true\">&lt;&lt;Form 1:Q1:a&gt;&gt;</span></span><span> has responded to the User Information Form.</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#000080\"><u><span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"invitation-token\" data-invitation-config=\"{&quot;form&quot;:&quot;Form 2&quot;,&quot;project&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;displayText&quot;:&quot;Click here&quot;,&quot;isPrivate&quot;:false,&quot;authToken&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\" style=\"color:#000080;text-decoration:underline\">Click here</span></u></span><span> to go to the Administration Form.</span></p><p></p><p><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "Document 2",
      "content": "<p><span>This Document appears if you selected </span><span><b>Exit</b></span><span>in the Administration Form.</span></p><p></p><p><span>All done! Thank you!</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "Document 3",
      "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>Error: The name </b></span><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span class=\"field-token function-table-token\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-field-name=\"Form 2:Q1:a\" title=\"Form 2:Q1:a\" draggable=\"true\">&lt;&lt;Form 2:Q1:a&gt;&gt;</span></b></span><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b> is not in the list.</b></span></p><p></p><p><span><b>Try again!</b></span></p><p></p>"
    }
  ],
